                "pass_filenames": false,
                "enabled": false,
                "_comment": "GE-100a/GE-100b: Scans staged source files for copy-paste clones using jscpd. Disabled by default (duplicate_code.enabled: false). Fails open when jscpd is not installed — emits advisory to stderr with install guidance and exits 0. Fails open on jscpd v4.x (incompatible CLI). Set strict: true to block commits on threshold violations."
            },
            {
                "id": "check-diff-coverage",
