                "pass_filenames": false,
                "_comment": "EPIC-FinalizeFeatureHardening/02: Blocks commits when any templates/workflows-js/*.js file contains a non-literal value (string concatenation, template-literal substitution, spread operator, call expression, or bare identifier) in its `export const meta` block. The Workflow runtime requires pure literals; any deviation causes a silent runtime failure. See docs/architecture/adrs/ADR-006-flatten-supervisor-chain.md addendum (pure-literal meta contract)."
            },
